# Planned human-facing command aliases:
#   make doctor   - inspect the Linux/CUDA/Isaac software stack
#   make test     - run pure-Python and simulator-backed tests
#   make smoke    - reset and step the environment with a dummy agent
#   make train    - launch a configured training run
#   make eval     - replay a checkpoint on deterministic scenarios
#   make report   - summarize evaluation traces
#
# Targets will be added when their underlying scripts are implemented and verified.

